diff --git a/CHANGELOG.md b/CHANGELOG.md
index 9806b52..6d657c3 100644
--- a/CHANGELOG.md
+++ b/CHANGELOG.md
@@ -9,6 +9,8 @@ ## [Unreleased]
 
 ### Added
 
+- Entities and memberships: `entities` (slug-routed, soft deletes) and `entity_memberships` with roles `owner`/`admin`/`employee`. A stored generated `owner_seq` column plus a unique index keeps at most one owner per entity on SQLite and MariaDB. Policies for entities and memberships.
+- Entity pages: `entity.pick` (stores the current entity in the session, audited), and owner/admin Livewire pages for the dashboard, members (add, assign role, remove) and settings (edit, delete, ownership transfer).
 - Database schema and Mermaid diagram in [`docs/database-schema.md`](docs/database-schema.md).
 - Business rules documentation in [`docs/business-rules.md`](docs/business-rules.md): MVP queue management, entity/subscription, roles (admin, owner, employee), tickets, priorities, fairness (3-ticket rule), deterministic call panel, and channels (Flutter totem, web TV, attendant).
 - This changelog (Keep a Changelog).
